React Collaboration Platform (Frontend)

This is the React-based web application for the professional collaboration network.

How to Run This Project

Place Files:
Make sure all the frontend files are in this frontend directory.

README.md

package.json

.gitignore

public/ (folder)

index.html

src/ (folder)

App.jsx

index.css

index.js

Install Dependencies:
Open a terminal in this frontend directory and run:

npm install

This will read package.json and install React and other necessary packages.

Start the Development Server:
Once installation is complete, run:

npm start

This will open the application in your web browser, typically at http://localhost:3000.

How It Works

src/App.jsx: This is the main application file containing all your React components, UI, and logic.

src/index.js: This file takes your App component and renders it into the index.html page.

public/index.html: This is the single HTML page. It includes a <script> tag for the Tailwind CSS CDN, which makes all the styling work without any build setup.
